            <section>
               <title value="Hospital course note"/>
               <code>
                  <coding>
                     <system value="http://loinc.org"/>
                     <code value="8648-8"/>
                     <display value="Hospital course note"/>
                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear Colleague, I am writing to inform you about the recent hospitalisation of your 84-year-old male patient admitted on 11/10/2022 with an acute exacerbation of his known chronic obstructive pulmonary disease. On admission, he presented with increased dyspnoea, productive cough, and reduced oxygen saturation. Clinical examination, chest X-ray, arterial blood gas analysis, and pulse oximetry confirmed the exacerbation. Blood tests were taken to exclude secondary causes. The patient was treated with nebulised bronchodilators, systemic corticosteroids, supplemental oxygen therapy, and closely monitored vital signs throughout his stay. He responded well to treatment with improvement in respiratory function and oxygen saturation. He was discharged on 12/10/2022 in a stable condition. I recommend continuation of his inhaled therapy and close outpatient follow-up. Please do not hesitate to contact me should you require further information.</div>
               </text>
            </section>
